WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.078 --> 00:00:05.749
A few minutes earlier, Zann and Perda had been chasing Zing through First City.

2
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:09.853
The dragon was flying along the street, staying just out of reach.

3
00:00:09.854 --> 00:00:14.071
Every few seconds, he stopped to shoot flames back in their direction.

4
00:00:14.072 --> 00:00:17.291
"Calm down, Zing," Zann called.

5
00:00:17.292 --> 00:00:21.457
"My parents are the ones who said you can't come to Mount Mystery with us.

6
00:00:21.458 --> 00:00:24.245
It wasn't my idea to leave you at the zoo!"

7
00:00:24.246 --> 00:00:28.457
Zing sent another angry fireball toward Zann's head.

8
00:00:28.458 --> 00:00:31.848
"Cut it out!" Zann shouted, ducking.

9
00:00:31.849 --> 00:00:39.082
Perda whistled. "Come on, Zing. You usually like staying with Mima."

10
00:00:39.083 --> 00:00:44.249
Mima was a Void animal caretaker and a friend of Zann's family.

11
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:48.874
Zann knew she would take great care of Zing while Zann was away.

12
00:00:48.875 --> 00:00:52.220
Zing perked up for a second at the mention of her name.

13
00:00:52.221 --> 00:00:56.082
But then he shot more fire and flew off again.

14
00:00:56.083 --> 00:00:58.999
"Argh!" Zann groaned.

15
00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.270
Perda laughed. "Come on. He'll get bored with this game eventually."

16
00:01:06.271 --> 00:01:10.666
The kids chased Zing through a park and past a couple of restaurants.

17
00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:14.332
Finally the little dragon disappeared around a corner.

18
00:01:14.333 --> 00:01:19.416
Zann paused to catch his breath. "We should stop and send a message to Zella.

19
00:01:19.417 --> 00:01:24.317
Boz contacted the mayor of Stone Wall to let her know we're coming to check out that cave.

20
00:01:24.318 --> 00:01:26.886
But I want to let Zella and her friends know too.

21
00:01:26.887 --> 00:01:31.804
After all, they're the ones who discovered the cave and spotted the possible relic."

22
00:01:31.805 --> 00:01:34.566
"We don't have to stop," Perda said.

23
00:01:34.567 --> 00:01:40.832
"I'll summon a spy fly. We can record a video message while we're chasing your goofy dragon."

24
00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:42.886
"Good plan," Zann said.

25
00:01:42.887 --> 00:01:48.582
Perda snapped her fingers. Seconds later a spy fly buzzed over to them.

26
00:01:48.583 --> 00:01:52.334
Perda created friction and then touched the spy fly.

27
00:01:52.335 --> 00:01:57.620
"Video blink!" she said. "Okay, Zann, we can start recording."

28
00:01:57.621 --> 00:02:00.929
Zann cleared his throat and looked at the fly.

29
00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:05.374
"Hi, Zella. Perda and I are in First City, and we wanted to tell you something."

30
00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:10.416
Perda waved. "Hey, Zella. The cave you found sounds cool."

31
00:02:10.417 --> 00:02:14.436
Zann spotted Zing peering back around the corner at them.

32
00:02:14.437 --> 00:02:18.413
He headed after the little dragon, talking while he walked.

33
00:02:18.414 --> 00:02:22.446
Perda stayed by his side, and the fly hovered in front of them.

34
00:02:22.447 --> 00:02:26.572
"We told my parents about the staff that disappeared," Zann said.

35
00:02:26.573 --> 00:02:31.089
"They're concerned, especially because it might have belonged to old King Zanta.

36
00:02:31.090 --> 00:02:37.924
And because something terrible happened—the Mask of Zanta just disappeared from the palace."

37
00:02:37.925 --> 00:02:41.832
"Nobody can figure out how it disappeared," Perda said.

38
00:02:41.833 --> 00:02:45.957
"Everyone who entered the safe room was authorized to be there.

39
00:02:45.958 --> 00:02:49.152
And there are protective barriers inside the palace.

40
00:02:49.153 --> 00:02:55.128
Nobody can zap in there, or use a Masking spell or an Invisibility spell or anything like that."

41
00:02:55.129 --> 00:02:58.270
"My mom thinks a Festian might have taken it."

42
00:02:58.271 --> 00:03:01.832
Zann thought back over what his parents had said.

43
00:03:01.833 --> 00:03:06.298
"She and Dad visited Fest once during their travels through the vortex.

44
00:03:06.299 --> 00:03:10.374
They said it's an odd world with fairly weak magic."

45
00:03:10.375 --> 00:03:12.957
A short distance ahead lay the river.

46
00:03:12.958 --> 00:03:17.207
Zing was sitting on the bank, keeping an eye on them as they approached.

47
00:03:17.208 --> 00:03:20.970
Zann lunged forward, trying to grab the dragon's wing.

48
00:03:20.971 --> 00:03:23.259
But Zing took off just in time.

49
00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:26.834
He flew over the river and landed on the far side.

50
00:03:26.835 --> 00:03:30.886
Then he looked back and hooted triumphantly at the kids.

51
00:03:30.887 --> 00:03:34.291
"Drat!" Zann snapped his fingers to levitate.

52
00:03:34.292 --> 00:03:38.875
While he and Perda floated over the river, he kept talking to the spy fly.

53
00:03:38.876 --> 00:03:42.916
"I'd never heard of Fest before. It sounds pretty weird.

54
00:03:42.917 --> 00:03:47.457
The people there are shape-shifters. They can look like anyone."

55
00:03:47.458 --> 00:03:51.048
"Anyone humanoid, that is," Perda said.

56
00:03:51.049 --> 00:03:55.624
"So a Festian can look exactly like Zann or like the queen.

57
00:03:55.625 --> 00:03:59.295
But they can't look nonhuman like a dragon or a tree."

58
00:03:59.296 --> 00:04:01.749
Zann landed on the far bank.

59
00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:09.874
"Anyway, my mom and the other adults think maybe a Festian shifted shape to look like someone who was allowed to go in with the relics."

60
00:04:09.875 --> 00:04:15.957
"Right," Perda said. "That way the guard wouldn't stop him or her from going in.

61
00:04:15.958 --> 00:04:22.163
The Festian could have walked right out with the pieces of the mask hidden under his or her clothes."

62
00:04:22.164 --> 00:04:26.907
Zing had flown up into a tree. He was staring at a bird.

63
00:04:26.908 --> 00:04:30.416
Zann saw his chance and rubbed his hands together.

64
00:04:30.417 --> 00:04:33.332
"What are you doing?" Perda asked quietly.

65
00:04:33.333 --> 00:04:36.347
"You'll see." Zann grinned at her.

66
00:04:36.348 --> 00:04:39.300
She wasn't the only one who could be clever with magic.

67
00:04:39.301 --> 00:04:42.770
He pointed to a spot just above Zing in the tree.

68
00:04:42.771 --> 00:04:46.701
Poof! A net appeared there, hanging in midair.

69
00:04:46.702 --> 00:04:51.220
When Zann brought his hand down, the net fell right over Zing.

70
00:04:51.221 --> 00:04:54.043
The little dragon squealed with dismay.

71
00:04:54.044 --> 00:04:58.209
He shot fire out of his mouth, trying to burn through the net.

72
00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:03.541
But it was too late. The net tumbled to the ground, and Zann grabbed him.

73
00:05:03.542 --> 00:05:09.020
"Give up, Zing," he said, ignoring the burn from the dragon's angry flames.

74
00:05:09.021 --> 00:05:14.978
"I won. But don't worry, I told Mima to give you all the dried squiggle fish you can eat."

75
00:05:14.979 --> 00:05:19.541
Zing suddenly went still at the mention of his favorite treat.

76
00:05:19.542 --> 00:05:22.283
Perda laughed at the dragon's reaction.

77
00:05:22.284 --> 00:05:25.457
"Sorry about the interruption, Zella.

78
00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:28.495
We should probably end this and get to the zoo.

79
00:05:28.496 --> 00:05:33.727
Oh! That reminds me, we didn't tell you the main reason we're sending you this message."

80
00:05:33.728 --> 00:05:36.053
"Right," Zann said.

81
00:05:36.054 --> 00:05:43.582
"The queen wants to know more about your cave and that disappearing staff, in case they're connected to King Zanta and the mask.

82
00:05:43.583 --> 00:05:47.738
So she's sending a group of people to Stone Wall to check it out.

83
00:05:47.739 --> 00:05:52.957
My parents, my grandfather, and a few others are going, along with . . . "

84
00:05:52.958 --> 00:06:00.299
He grinned. "The two of us. We leave first thing in the morning!"
